  OpenOLMS v1.0 — Open Offline Mail System
  Drop-in replacement for Peter Rocca's
  OLMS Version 2000. QWK/QWKE/BlueWave
  offline mail door for RemoteAccess,
  PCBoard, and compatible BBS software.
  Binary-compatible data files. All 7
  programs included. GPLv3. Free Pascal.
